<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Comcast UK raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Comcast UK raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities has raised its rating for Comcast UK Cable Partners Ltd to buy from hold, a source at the firm said on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- The company's stock opened unchanged at 12-1/4.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
